    "q-146310": {
      "dom_id": "step-q146310",
      "name": "Question 5",
      "problem": "The vector $u$ has magnitude $1,$ the vector $v$ has magnitude $5,$ and $u∥v.$ Find $u\\times v.$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose $u$ and $v$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $u\\times v=0$ if and only if $u∥v.$\n\nTherefore, $u\\times v=0.$",
