    "q-146314": {
      "dom_id": "step-q146314",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "The vector $c$ has magnitude $3,$ the vector $d$ has magnitude $4,$ and $c∥d.$ Find $c\\times d.$",
      "worked_solution": "Suppose $c$ and $d$ are nonzero vectors. Then, $c\\times d=0$ if and only if $c∥d.$\n\nTherefore, $c\\times d=0.$",
